  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve01",
      "hash64": "56B8FBC8C1F1307B",
      "text": "我这孩子无论在哪儿\\n都能说睡就睡呢。\\c\\n它是正在用宝可梦的招式\\n“睡觉”来回复体力吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve03",
      "hash64": "56B8FDC8C1F133E1",
      "text": "小卖部真的很方便！\\n而且去城镇买东西会让人发倦啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve06",
      "hash64": "56B900C8C1F138FA",
      "text": "我正要捕捉宝可梦时球不够用，\\n结果让宝可梦逃掉了！\\r\\n还是多买一些吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve07",
      "hash64": "56B901C8C1F13AAD",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve08",
      "hash64": "56B8F2C8C1F12130",
      "text": "刚出炉的面包香喷喷的味道！\\n虽然很不甘心，但我还是要买！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve09",
      "hash64": "56B8F3C8C1F122E3",
      "text": "你喜欢面包？\\n我是饭团派！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve10",
      "hash64": "56BC80C8C1F44851",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_eve11",
      "hash64": "56BC7FC8C1F4469E",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_ni02",
      "hash64": "686AA735F8946881",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_ni03",
      "hash64": "686AA635F89466CE",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_ni04",
      "hash64": "686AA935F8946BE7",
      "text": "嗯……要买伤药、\\n解毒药、解麻药……\\r\\n解冻药是不是也该买呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_ni05",
      "hash64": "686AA835F8946A34",
      "text": "我是来买能和宝可梦\\n一起吃的宵夜的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_ni06",
      "hash64": "686AAB35F8946F4D",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "a_sch_shop01_ni07",
      "hash64": "686AAA35F8946D9A",
      "text": "这里的面包软乎乎的！\\n就算牙口不好也能放心地吃。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
